// The third-party licences and notices Sprite3DBuilder must carry, linked
// into the program as RCDATA resources so they are inside it on every
// platform and cannot be left out of a release. Sprite3DLicences reads them
// by these names; File, Licences... shows them and can save them all as one
// file.
//
// buildlicences.cmd, run from Sprite3DBuilder's styles pre-build step with
// the name Sprite3DBuilderLicences, compiles this file, from this folder,
// into Sprite3DBuilderLicences.res, which Sprite3DBuilder.dpr links in. The
// texts are shared with Sprite3D's Sprite3DLicences.rc. Add a licence here,
// as a text file in this folder, and to the list in
// Sprite3DBuilder/lib/Sprite3DLicences.pas.

LICENCE_NEON             RCDATA "Neon-LICENSE.txt"
LICENCE_VAMPYRE          RCDATA "Vampyre-LICENSE.txt"
